== About me
I am currently an Assistant Professor in School of Mathematical Sciences at Shenzhen University. In 2020, I received my Ph.D. degree in Operational Research and Cybernetics from Beijing University of Technology, under the supervision of Prof. Haibin Zhang.
I obtained my M.S. in Operational Research and Cybernetics under the supervision of [http://139.155.71.72:81/HomePage.aspx?ID=14 Prof. Fuquan Xia] in 2016 and B.S. in 
Mathematics and Applied Mathematic in 2013, both from [https://english.sicnu.edu.cn/EnglishIndex/webindex Sichuan Normal University]. [https://scholar.google.com/citations?hl=zh-CN&user=7IbzkWIAAAAJ&sortby=pubdate&view_op=list_works&gmla=AKKJWFc42C7DWIfABOE3-fKhwMS7eOC1xdYBu3Yds2jHxf-8JIxA6g2SSAsYPg2KBpBHSWrMER0AFtlht70Ut8nHVgbsz-EC8i8MCNfnJwA My link] on Google Scholar.


== Research Interests 
- My research interests lie in continuous optimization, with a particular focus on variational inequalities, nonconvex optimization, robust optimization, and error bound, among other topics.


== Grants

- Principal Investigator, National Natural Science Foundation of China, 2022.01-2024.12.

- Principal Investigator, Natural Science Foundation of Guangdong,2025.01-2027.12.
 

 



